#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:99
#: ae86eb78cd3c44b7ab0c1b732e2e8971
msgid ""
"W2 is a FiveAges wheeled-arm robot. Its URDF is public "
"([fa-w2-description](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-w2-description));"
" the usual workspace is [fa-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fa-deploy-ws) (default branch `fa-w2`). See [FiveAges robot "
"descriptions](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md) and "
"[fa-deploy-ws Setup](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"W2 是第五纪的轮臂机器人。它的 URDF 是公开的（[fa-w2-description](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/fa-w2-description)）；常用工作空间是 [fa-deploy-"
"ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws)（默认分支 `fa-w2`）。见 "
"[第五纪机器人描述](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md) 和 [fa-"
"deploy-ws 配置](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。"

