msgstr "第 3 天：fa-py-libraries 与 Viser"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:119
#: 417758580ba84bdeb68f152af8e0a204
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Install fa-py-libraries and open Viser in a browser, so you can"
" see the robot and send basic commands before you start Isaac Sim."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 安装 fa-py-libraries，并在浏览器里打开 Viser，这样在启动 Isaac Sim "
"之前就能看到机器人、发出基本指令。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:121
#: 71917cc8dc38456fb4cb2dc7697ebe1c
msgid ""
"Viser is the browser 3D view and control page from "
"[ros2-viser](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ros2-viser). Launch it from "
"**fa-py-libraries**, not as a standalone product and not from "
"lerobot_ros2."
msgstr ""
"Viser 是 [ros2-viser](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ros2-viser) "
"提供的浏览器三维查看与控制页面。从 **fa-py-libraries** 启动它，不要把它当成单独的产品，也不要从 lerobot_ros2 "
"启动。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:125
#: 9fdc48f65fe14a7eba648635f019e81c
msgid ""
"Keep a robot demo from Day 1 or Day 2 running. The ros2-viser README asks"
" you to start the control stack first; `/robot_description` must be "
"available."
msgstr ""
"先保持第 1 天或第 2 天的机器人演示在运行。ros2-viser 的 README 要求先启动运控；`/robot_description` "
"必须已经可用。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:126
#: 03c88e541c574939a3abb4cf0687439f
msgid ""
"Install fa-py-libraries (Python 3.12 env; this also installs "
"`ros2_robot_interface` and `ros2-viser`):"
msgstr ""
"安装 fa-py-libraries（Python 3.12 环境；同时会装上 `ros2_robot_interface` 和 "
"`ros2-viser`）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:127
#: e90073e3ae004b87b8eb8612ecabee64
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:132
#: 65b3d9e1dc8c45f9ac386287e4c40369
msgid "Start Viser from that repository:"
msgstr "从该仓库启动 Viser："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:133
#: b05399855937495abd412b6b6594f55f
msgid "./run.sh viser\n"
msgstr "./run.sh viser\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:136
#: acade0bf4e3c4003b3d6dee1e858d1d0
msgid ""
"`./run.sh` with no arguments opens a menu; item 1 is `ros2-viser launch`."
" The command runs `ros2-viser/launch.py`."
msgstr ""
"不带参数运行 `./run.sh` 会打开菜单；第 1 项是 `ros2-viser launch`。这条命令会执行 "
"`ros2-viser/launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:137
#: 4cfd0d2e46ea4fa2bf0787eafa26203a
msgid ""
"In a browser, open the URL that Viser prints in the terminal (`访问 URL`). "
"The same output shows the host and port; this launch has no separate "
"host/port flag. You can also scan the QR code it prints."
msgstr ""
"在浏览器里打开 Viser 在终端打印的地址（`访问 "
"URL`）。同一段输出里有主机和端口；这次启动没有单独的主机/端口参数。也可以扫描它打印的二维码。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:138
#: 7aabc0afb3db46de92a12524b7c6e38d
msgid ""
"The page starts as an empty scene. If only one robot is present, it loads"
" automatically. If there are several, pick one under “选择命名空间”. If the "
"robot comes up later, click “刷新命名空间列表”."
msgstr "页面一开始是空场景。如果当时只有一台机器人，会自动加载。如果有多台，在「选择命名空间」里选一个。如果机器人是后来才起来的，点「刷新命名空间列表」。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:139
#: b984db9db42d4f1e9dab945241697fa7
msgid ""
"Confirm the model is visible. For a first control check: use HOME / HOLD "
"on the state panel; switch to OCS2 and drag the end-effector handles; or "
"switch to MOVEJ, move the joint sliders, and send the target. On a mobile"
" base such as G1-D, `launch.py` sets the visualization frame to `world`; "
"you can also choose `map` or `odom` on the page so the model and the "
"handles share the same ground."
msgstr ""
"确认模型已经可见。第一次检查控制时：在状态面板用 HOME / HOLD；切到 OCS2，拖动末端手柄；或者切到 "
"MOVEJ，拉动关节滑条再发送目标。像 G1-D 这样的移动底盘，`launch.py` 会把可视化坐标系设为 `world`；也可以在页面上改成"
" `map` 或 `odom`，让模型和手柄落在同一地面上。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:141
#: 66d891af33324b01be607c56253a92cd
msgid ""
"Do not copy the rest of the Python API here. Full Viser UI: "
"[ros2-viser](../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md). Writing scripts"
" with `ROS2RobotInterface`: [Python "
"Interface](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md)."
msgstr ""
"这里不要再抄一遍其余 Python API。Viser 完整界面见 "
"[ros2-viser](../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md)。用 "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` 写脚本见 [Python "
"接口](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:143
#: 9381be138f9941edbe55fd980a35d737
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [fa-py-libraries](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fa-py-libraries), [ros2-viser](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2-viser)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [fa-py-libraries](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-"
"libraries)、[ros2-viser](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ros2-viser)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:145
#: fce8d418816d4d47b207546c97007ca4
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** You can open Viser in a browser, see the robot, and use the "
"page to move it while a demo is running."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 能在浏览器里打开 Viser，看到机器人，并在演示运行时用这个页面对它进行控制。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:147
#: 83ede694a0a2463d8a84fb5c03d18e5f
msgid "Day 4: Isaac Sim"
msgstr "第 4 天：Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:149
#: 34d21b97661c4fb19acecb03791c8ec1
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Run physics simulation in Isaac Sim (FaSim), instead of mock "
"hardware. This is the default simulation path."
msgstr "**目标：** 在 Isaac Sim（FaSim）里跑物理仿真，而不是 mock 硬件。这是默认的仿真路径。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:151
#: e92f99f2893a40358ac13dc471e9a1bb
msgid ""
"**FaSim** pairs NVIDIA Isaac Sim with the same ROS 2 运控 stack as the real"
" robot. Follow [Isaac Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md): "
"clone [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac), run "
"`./init.sh`, then `./run.sh`, and connect with **one** of the two paths "
"on that page (`hardware:=isaac`, or Play on a `ROS2ControlLaunch` "
"payload). Default Isaac path is `ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim`); override "
"in `config/fa_sim.local.conf`."
msgstr ""
"**FaSim** 把 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 和真机同一套 ROS 2 运控配在一起。按 [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md) 做：克隆 [FaSim-"
"Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac)，跑 `./init.sh`，再 "
"`./run.sh`，并只用那一页上的**一条**接入路径（`hardware:=isaac`，或在带 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 的"
" payload 上按 Play）。Isaac 默认路径是 `ISAACSIM_DIR`（`~/isaacsim`）；在 "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf` 里覆盖。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:153
#: d377cd7477ab48809af195e97712bf44
msgid ""
"Start Viser the way you did on Day 3, after the Isaac / ROS 2 stack is "
"up, so you can view and control the robot in the browser: [Start "
"Viser](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md#start-viser)."
msgstr ""
"Isaac / ROS 2 运控起来之后，按第 3 天的方式启动 Viser，就可以在浏览器里查看和控制机器人：[启动 "
"Viser](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md#start-viser)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:155
#: 9d696c00067e409985006027055d6561
msgid ""
"This clip is a G1-D demonstration of full-body control in Isaac Sim. On "
"the Viser web control interface, drag the dual-arm end-effector targets "
"and move the chassis in rotation and translation; G1-D in Isaac Sim moves"
" with it. Start Viser as in [Start "
"Viser](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md#start-viser) after"
" the stack is up."
msgstr ""
"这段视频是 G1-D 在 Isaac Sim 中做全身控制的演示。在 Viser 网页控制界面上拖动双臂末端目标，并控制底盘旋转和平移；Isaac"
" Sim 中的 G1-D 同步运动。运控起来之后，按 [启动 "
"Viser](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md#start-viser) 启动 "
"Viser。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:157
#: 42d83affc05543fe8217fc7f187558af
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../_static/videos/isaac-g1d-full-body-mobile.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../_static/videos/isaac-g1d-full-body-mobile.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:163
#: 322a0117265a40498ed2fce09b61872b
msgid ""
"The same clip, and the rest of the Isaac Sim steps, are on [G1-D full-"
"body control and chassis "
"motion](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md#g1-d-full-body-control-"
"and-chassis-motion)."
msgstr ""
"同一段视频，以及其余 Isaac Sim 步骤，见 [G1-D "
"全身控制与底盘运动](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md#g1-d-full-body-"
"control-and-chassis-motion)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:165
#: c7ea27ce7b054b8799edabba6e9ee894
msgid ""
"What the two connections and the Kit extensions do: [FaSim-"
"Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md). Assets: "
"[robot_usds](../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md), [Environment "
"assets](../4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md)."
msgstr ""
"两种接入方式和 Kit 扩展做什么，见 [FaSim-"
"Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。资产见 "
"[robot_usds](../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md)、[环境资产](../4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:167
#: 392c5eefabc6477dafb7c56423c1daf0
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac), [robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac)、[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:169
#: 4e1825af177a49ddaf4cb81d536dcceb
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** You can start FaSim and see the robot move in Isaac Sim with"
" the same ROS 2 运控 as the real robot, plus simulation ground truth."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 能启动 FaSim，看到机器人在 Isaac Sim 中运动，运控与真机同一套 ROS 2 运控，并带仿真真值。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:171
#: 35400d7131014127b017eecb9ef92831
msgid "Gazebo (alternative)"
msgstr "Gazebo（备选）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:173
#: 13de2236f69a429c993d6252cc563b6a
msgid ""
"If you need Gazebo Harmonic instead, follow [Gazebo "
"Simulation](../2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md):"
msgstr ""
"如果需要改用 Gazebo Harmonic，按 [Gazebo "
"仿真](../2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md)："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:175
#: 6cf780e627b445e49813f6911985bc3e
msgid ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"
msgstr ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:183
#: 156deb3345eb43fb8e6cbcac0b88ced6
msgid "Day 5: Teleoperation"
msgstr "第 5 天：遥操作"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:185
#: 661e2b73d5e0444ca7344f7829e3a47c
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Start with VR or a game controller, then know what the other "
"input methods are for."
msgstr "**目标：** 先用 VR 或游戏手柄上手，再了解其他输入方式各自做什么。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:187
#: a572c79b80df404d866c7989e7f72ea0
msgid ""
"Keep the robot stack from Days 1–4 running. Teleop publishes targets or "
"assist events into that stack."
msgstr "保持第 1 到第 4 天的机器人运控在运行。遥操作把目标或辅助事件发进这套运控。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:189
#: f40b49929b83469cb34b37fe94b22f85
msgid ""
"Inputs in this stack have different jobs: **end-effector pose** (VR "
"controllers, Vive Tracker, DexCap exoskeleton arms), **joint-space "
"following** (isomorphic teleop), **fingers / grippers** (VR triggers, "
"Wuji gloves, DexCap gloves), and **enable / pause / FSM assists** (some "
"VR buttons, the joystick enable switch, the foot pedal)."
msgstr ""
"这套系统里，不同输入承担不同职责：**末端位姿**（VR 手柄、Vive Tracker、DexCap "
"外骨骼的手臂）、**关节空间跟随**（同构遥操作）、**手指 / 夹爪**（VR 扳机、Wuji 手套、DexCap 手套），以及**使能 / "
"暂停 / FSM 辅助**（部分 VR 按键、手柄使能开关、脚踏板）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:191
#: 7ee5873f97834f599090881def7a1f0e
msgid "Start here: VR"
msgstr "从这里开始：VR"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:193
#: 1cc703cb499a40298183f07723153f6e
msgid ""
"**What it is for.** Drive the arms from the headset controllers’ end-"
"effector pose. Triggers operate the gripper or hand. Buttons handle FSM, "
"pause, and — on 全身 — some arm enable/disable assists. Use this path when "
"you have a Pico or Quest headset."
msgstr ""
"**适合做什么。** 用头显配套手柄的末端位姿来带动手臂。扳机关夹爪或灵巧手。按键处理 FSM、暂停，以及在全身上的部分手臂使能/禁用辅助。有 "
"Pico 或 Quest 头显时走这条路径。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:195
#: 43302e05382e4c83b970de8d30f277b0
msgid ""
"**Minimum steps.** Follow [VR "
"Teleoperation](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md). You need fa-"
"py-libraries from Day 3, `enable_vr: true` in the description’s "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default off), and a "
"network to the headset. Then:"
msgstr ""
"**最短步骤。** 按 [VR 遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。你需要第 3 "
"天的 fa-py-libraries，在描述包的 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 里把 `enable_vr:"
" true`（多数机器人默认是关闭的），以及通向头显的网络。然后："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:197
#: e32a988b23b2404287de5e7245ecf6c8
msgid ""
"cd ~/fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:202
#: c521f02dc41b4792aa8520e3c8d15ed8
msgid ""
"With no arguments the menu prints `请选择要启动的功能`. WebXR is `6) vr pose "
"launch (Vuer/WebXR)`. Open the printed URL in the headset browser. "
"XRoboToolkit is `4) 启动 XRoboToolkit PC Service`, then `3) 手柄遥操 "
"(controller)`. The same steps as commands are `./run.sh vr`, and "
"`./run.sh vr-xrt-service` then `./run.sh vr-xrt`. Pico **Enterprise** is "
"the preferred Pico SKU (USB 网络共享, and its own App)."
msgstr "不带参数时，菜单会打印 `请选择要启动的功能`。WebXR 是 `6) vr pose launch (Vuer/WebXR)`。在头显浏览器里打开打印出来的 URL。XRoboToolkit 先选 `4) 启动 XRoboToolkit PC Service`，再选 `3) 手柄遥操 (controller)`。对应的命令是 `./run.sh vr`，以及先 `./run.sh vr-xrt-service` 再 `./run.sh vr-xrt`。Pico **企业版** 是优先的 Pico 型号（USB 网络共享，以及它自己的 App）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:204
#: 9b9bd8af89394e71bcb7302f531f2192
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**What you should see.** The arms follow the VR controllers once the "
"session is in UPDATE, and you can change FSM and the gripper from the "
"controller buttons. The current mode (UPDATE or STORAGE, mirror, per-arm "
"pause) is on `teleop/mode_state`. {ref}`teleop-mode-status`."
msgstr ""
"**预期看到的结果。** 会话进入 UPDATE 后，手臂跟随 VR 手柄，也可以用手柄按键切换 FSM、操作夹爪。当前模式（UPDATE 或 "
"STORAGE、镜像、单臂暂停）在 `teleop/mode_state`。{ref}`teleop-mode-status`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:206
#: 5702fe3ee3c64a498ed0a9340f2b9097
msgid "Start here: game controller (joystick)"
msgstr "从这里开始：游戏手柄（joystick）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:208
#: 0c8d8998a763447db2897931d731a590
msgid ""
"**What it is for.** A gamepad or joystick, without a headset, to command "
"arm velocity (`control_input` → `/left_target/twist` and "
"`/right_target/twist`) and, in chassis mode, `/cmd_vel`. Use this path "
"when you only have a game controller."
msgstr ""
"**适合做什么。** 不用头显，用游戏手柄或摇杆以速度方式控制手臂（`control_input` → `/left_target/twist` "
"和 `/right_target/twist`），在底盘模式下还可以发 `/cmd_vel`。只有游戏手柄时走这条路径。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:210
#: 76023ac5de77400796278cd39b25dad6
msgid ""
"**Minimum steps.** With the robot stack already running, follow [Joystick"
" teleop](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md):"
msgstr ""
"**最短步骤。** 在机器人运控已经运行的前提下，按 "
"[手柄遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md)："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:212
#: 7e58ffdc50e3491ebd5664681e415d48
msgid "ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py\n"
msgstr "ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:216
#: 9c70e66eb94142808fe98cce86dbf3b3
msgid ""
"Joystick control starts disabled; press the right stick to enable it "
"(package README). Most mapped gamepads use the generic SDL layout "
"automatically."
msgstr "手柄控制默认是关闭的；按下右摇杆使能（见软件包 README）。大多数已映射的游戏手柄会自动使用通用 SDL 布局。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:218
#: 2653276822ed45faa8b942fa096807d4
msgid ""
"**What you should see.** After you enable the controller, stick motion "
"changes the arm target, or the chassis in chassis mode."
msgstr "**预期看到的结果。** 使能之后，拨动摇杆会改变手臂目标；在底盘模式下则控制底盘。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:220
#: dbcb6607b33840e698324c5b56e95098
msgid "Other methods"
msgstr "其他方式"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:222
#: 08436450d62f460c8b5108824939cb0d
msgid ""
"These are additional ways to supply pose, finger, or assist signals. "
"Setup for each one is on the linked page."
msgstr "这些是另外提供位姿、手指或辅助信号的方式。每一种的布置在对应页面上。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:224
#: 33ffdd4b8bb34a6ea84fb197cda272f7
msgid ""
"**Isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作) — Master–slave joint following on "
"HighTorque Panthera HT. On the `panthera-ht` branch, real-robot teleop is"
" `./teleop_start.sh`: [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md), "
"[Isomorphic Teleop](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr "**同构遥操作** — 在 HighTorque Panthera HT 上做主从关节跟随。`panthera-ht` 分支上，真机遥操作是 `./teleop_start.sh`：[HighTorque Panthera HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)、[同构遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:225
#: 8288e3719dd64fe2a416c7370eeb824f
msgid ""
"**DexCap exoskeleton and gloves** (internal) — The exoskeleton measures "
"waist and arm joints; the gloves measure finger joints. Combined arm + "
"hand teleop: [DexCap "
"Teleoperation](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/8-dexcap_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"**DexCap 外骨骼和手套**（内部）— 外骨骼测腰部和手臂关节，手套测手指关节。臂手一体遥操作：[DexCap "
"遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/8-dexcap_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:226
#: 4da3002175134a2e888a1d933ce8ee10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**VR gesture / hand tracking** — Optical wrist and bare-hand gestures: "
"`./run.sh vr-xrt wrist` or `./run.sh vr-hand` on {ref}`Hand tracking <vr-"
"hand-tracking>`. Controller mode stays `./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`."
msgstr "**VR 手势 / 手部追踪** — 光学腕和空手手势：`./run.sh vr-xrt wrist` 或 `./run.sh vr-hand`，见 {ref}`手部追踪 <vr-hand-tracking>`。手柄模式仍是 `./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:227
#: 90dd3caa9f21487b9a656ae51123ee30
msgid ""
"**Wuji gloves** (internal) — Finger and hand joint teleop, with optional "
"Vive Tracker for arm pose: "
"[wuji_glove_teleop](../4-reference/teleop/5-wuji_glove.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Wuji 手套**（内部）— 手指和手部关节遥操作，可选配 Vive Tracker "
"来带动手臂：[wuji_glove_teleop](../4-reference/teleop/5-wuji_glove.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:228
#: 5a384ef1977c402d88e4e8da1cb2f41b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Foot pedal** — An assist beside VR or the game controller. "
"`foot_pedal_teleop` in `arms_teleop` publishes events on the relative "
"topic `teleop/controller_state` (FSM up/down, arm teleop, STORAGE/UPDATE,"
" mirror). The current mode comes back on `teleop/mode_state`: {ref}`Foot "
"pedal <foot-pedal-assist-only>`."
msgstr "**脚踏板** — 放在 VR 或游戏手柄旁边的辅助输入。`arms_teleop` 里的 `foot_pedal_teleop` 在相对话题 `teleop/controller_state` 上发布事件（FSM 上/下、手臂遥操、STORAGE/UPDATE、镜像）。当前模式由 `teleop/mode_state` 返回：{ref}`脚踏板 <foot-pedal-assist-only>`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:229
#: 023958650ae54336b4ad7f4609874fdf
msgid ""
"**Vive Tracker** (internal) — SteamVR **Vive Tracker** poses mapped to "
"arm end-effector targets (`vive_tracker_teleop`). The package and these "
"docs call it **Vive Tracker**: [Vive "
"Tracker](../4-reference/teleop/6-vive_tracker.md)."
msgstr "**Vive Tracker**（内部）— 把 SteamVR **Vive Tracker** 位姿映射到手臂末端目标（`vive_tracker_teleop`）。软件包和本文档都叫它 **Vive Tracker**：[Vive Tracker](../4-reference/teleop/6-vive_tracker.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:231
#: a150864f23974cf9b1c9dd27e07ec1b8
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [VR "
"Teleoperation](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md), [arms_teleop "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [VR "
"遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)、[arms_teleop "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:233
#: bd1871c0fb154da29892842ba62328bf
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** You can run either the VR path or the game-controller path, "
"and you can tell which of the other devices is for pose, fingers, or "
"enable/pause assists."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 你能跑通 VR 或游戏手柄其中一条路径，并且分得清其他设备分别用于位姿、手指，还是使能/暂停辅助。"

