msgstr "见 [fa-deploy-ws 配置](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:270
#: 1f3702c3d84344e5911d4001ae135c7a
msgid ""
"**Safety:** Prove the motion in `mock_components`, or in the sim path "
"that workspace documents, before you set `hardware:=real`."
msgstr "**安全：** 先在 `mock_components`，或该工作区文档里的仿真路径上把动作跑通，再设 `hardware:=real`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:273
#: 62b585fbb5264ae8a2efe7ab470a231b
msgid "Day 7: Bring one new robot into FaSim"
msgstr "第 7 天：把一台新机器人接入 FaSim"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:275
#: 0584de049b7b434ca3397187344f19b6
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Independently connect a robot that is not already a demo, so "
"Isaac and the ROS 2 stack move it. This is the exam, not a walkthrough of"
" CR5 or W2. You are done when a command moves that robot in the viewport "
"and you can hand in the items below."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 独立接上一台还不是现成 demo 的机器人，让 Isaac 和 ROS 2 运控把它动起来。这是考核，不是再走一遍 CR5 或 "
"W2。一条指令能在视口里带动这台机器人，并且能交出下面这些材料，这一天就算完成。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:277
#: 6d890554c007417d8872b2342ead16b5
msgid ""
"**Before you start.** Finish Days 0–4. You can reach HOLD with "
"`hardware:=mock_components`, Viser opens in the browser, Isaac Sim is "
"installed, `ISAACSIM_DIR` is set, and you have run FaSim `./init.sh` and "
"`./run.sh`."
msgstr ""
"**开始之前。** 做完第 0 到第 4 天。你能用 `hardware:=mock_components` 进到 HOLD，Viser "
"能在浏览器里打开，Isaac Sim 已安装，`ISAACSIM_DIR` 已设置，并且已经跑过 FaSim 的 `./init.sh` 和 "
"`./run.sh`。"

